<% content_for :title, "The agent contract — RiceSpace" %>

<div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">The agent contract</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500">
    Fetch it raw: <%= link_to agents_markdown_path, agents_markdown_path, class: "text-fuchsia-400 hover:text-fuchsia-300" %>
  </p>
</div>

<p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-sm text-zinc-400">
  This is the document an account owner hands to a coding agent along with a token. It is served
  as-is at <code class="text-zinc-300">/agents.md</code>, so what you read here is what the agent
  reads.
</p>

<article class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6">
  <pre class="whitespace-pre-wrap font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-300"><%= AgentContract.markdown %></pre>
</article>
